  "2026-10-14T16:06:31.056Z","harness:codex","Implementation scope: shared semantic extension flag declaration, preserving legacy bool spaced false/0 grammar independently of canonical boolean switches. Pair with pm-gh1467 in one reviewed delivery, with independently asserted echo behavior and required exact-candidate packaged pre-publication acceptance. Live intake read all2965 items with no omissions,2685 closed and zero in_progress; closed pm-gh1461 remains completed. GitHub initial inventory has zero open PRs, zero open Dependabot/code/secret alerts and24 open issues. Every pre-existing issue link verified; four new reports are being mapped to canonical owners."
  "2026-10-14T16:20:19.050Z","harness:codex","Verified official public2026.10.14 tarball against registry SHA512 integrity; unchanged semantic echo fixture reproduces false-to-true with leftover positional false. Candidate source integration now passes37 declared cases across nested/flattened commands: exact boolean values, optional/required arity, list ordering, short forms, remaining operands, required-flag presence and safe refusals. Independent seeded lost-optionality and false-to-true controls are required to fail for their named semantic assertions. Full coverage, complete static and npm/Bun/npx/bunx packed acceptance are running; none is claimed passed yet."
  "2026-10-14T16:23:15.027Z","harness:codex","The independently verified public2026.10.14 SDK also reproduces the second failure: --maybe [label] reports help takes_value=true/value_required=false while public SDK machine contracts report value_required=true. Both original bug signatures are now confirmed on an integrity-verified published artifact, not source reconstruction. Source and candidate acceptance are separate from the next future daily release. The new malformed-scalar validation enhancement is recorded as pm-extension-scalar-validation and remains open/unclaimed."
  "2026-10-14T16:38:20.164Z","harness:codex","Retained complete first validation receipt:10422 tests passed,5 failed,3 skipped; no coverage certification emitted. Three old contract expectations need explicit arity metadata and legacy bool grammar updates; the publication workflow fixture lacked the new mandatory acceptance environment, and an existing packed continuation test could not discover npm/package.json from this mixed-prefix host. No timeout was hit in that continuation test. Correcting test expectations and adding executed failed/missing-acceptance publication controls. The installed npm package will be exposed only through this validation process NODE_PATH; all source membership, deadlines and exact coverage thresholds remain unchanged. Concurrent packed smoke waited for the build lease and reached its existing600-second deadline; it will run sequentially after the complete test/static lease holders."
  "2026-10-14T16:50:47.624Z","harness:codex","Accepted CodeRabbit inline finding4273627058: preserve the bare bool form accepted by the current published14 artifact alongside pre-existing explicit false/0 forms. Revised shared grammar makes an unlabelled legacy bool optional-valued, retains required <value> declarations, and keeps canonical boolean switches unchanged. Added independent bare and positional-before-flag echo cases. This supersedes the earlier interim bare-bool refusal expectation without rewriting its evidence. Complete final code and packed acceptance will be rerun before closure."
  "2026-10-14T17:01:45.578Z","harness:codex","Retained interim broad validation:10425 tests pass and the original5 failures are corrected; the only2 remaining failures used the compiled mandatory-bool artifact from the run started before accepted review feedback. No test or threshold was skipped or weakened. A fresh build and focused review controls, packed Node/Bun/npx/bunx acceptance and a complete stable-source coverage run now execute sequentially, avoiding the earlier build-lease queue timeout. Required source39-case and packed40-case inventories are frozen for this validation."
  "2026-10-14T17:38:33.664Z","harness:codex","Frozen full coverage execution completed: 10,426 tests passed, 3 skipped, and one workflow-contract assertion failed because it still expected the pre-concurrency-limit Windows command. Exact coverage independently passed with zero uncovered counts: statements 68,682/68,682, branches 52,621/52,621, functions 14,148/14,148, lines 65,234/65,234. All five retained implementation/fixture digests matched the frozen source. Updated only the stale command assertion, retaining the complete pinned keeper list; focused workflow verification and complete static gate are now running. This is not yet a combined green verdict."
  "2026-10-14T19:11:42.023Z","harness:codex","Final candidate verification:146 focused privacy/export checks pass;81 registered-hook tests give exact helper coverage104/104 statements,62/62 branches,10/10 functions,88/88 lines. Packed npm/npx/Bun/bunx9-workflow acceptance passes40 extension and33 diagnostic cases on Node/Bun. Typecheck, graph composition at the unchanged prose bound, record integrity and registered mutation controls pass. Native linked tests are now recorded successful for every selected item, with required case metrics40/40/33; inherited privacy links were reviewed and clone-locally acknowledged without changing trust policy. Complete local static passes all gates through10 SDK import budgets but fails qualified CLI startup ceilings; the existing startup diagnosis retains that failure, and full exact-head hosted static/coverage/review are mandatory before merge. Public2026.10.14 remains the integrity-verified failing baseline; no second same-day release is created."
